# Validation data: the files the adapters actually read are committed under
# validate/data via Git LFS. Everything else stays local — the multi-GB Community
# Notes raw shards, the downloaded archives (re-derivable), and redundant dataset
# extras (MovieLens CV splits, Coat side features). See validate/README.md.
validate/data/**/raw/
validate/data/**/_extract/
validate/data/**/*.zip
validate/data/coat/coat/user_item_features/
validate/data/movielens/ml-100k/*
!validate/data/movielens/ml-100k/u.data

# LaTeX build artifacts from whitepaper/compile.sh (the .pdf itself is committed)
whitepaper/*.aux
whitepaper/*.log
whitepaper/*.toc
whitepaper/*.out
whitepaper/dbg.*
